  "raw": "{\"answer\":\"ToG 的图探索：原文说“ToG implements the ‘LLM ⊗KG’ paradigm by asking LLM to perform beam search on knowledge graph”，并要求 LLM“iteratively explore multiple possible reasoning paths on KGs until the LLM determines that the question can be answered based on the current reasoning paths”[chunk_d6a1257a27b9a4e3fd151b8c87ebf491]。ToG-2 的图与文档联动：原文把其优势概括为“through the guide of KGs”进行深度检索，并“treating documents as node contexts, achieving a tight-coupling combination of KG and text RAG”[chunk_c9284a24e2b28b371a7e43a2bc6ae3c2]；同一段还称 ToG-2“iteratively performs a collaborative retrieval process based on KG and text”[chunk_c9284a24e2b28b371a7e43a2bc6ae3c2]。关于适用场景，ToG-2 论文的结论称 ToG 擅长“rapid, triplet-based reasoning”，而 ToG-2 擅长“detailed contextual reasoning”[chunk_dbc1fae04646d9e523a5b16481732daf]。\",\"citations\":[{\"chunk_id\":\"chunk_d6a1257a27b9a4e3fd151b8c87ebf491\",\"quote_id\":\"q1\"},{\"chunk_id\":\"chunk_c9284a24e2b28b371a7e43a2bc6ae3c2\",\"quote_id\":\"q1\"},{\"chunk_id\":\"chunk_dbc1fae04646d9e523a5b16481732daf\",\"quote_id\":\"q1\"}],\"status\":\"ok\"}",
